        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The New Pornographers, Kings of Leon, Taylor Locke and The Roughs, Rooney, Price, FIDLAR, Queens of the Stone Age, Florence and the Machine, Kasabian\n- People: Taylor Locke, Chris Price, Brandon Schwartzel, Joe Seiders, David Guetta\n- Events: Orange Warsaw Festival 2014\n- Places: Vancouver, British Columbia, Nashville, Tennessee, National Stadium\n\nFacts:\n- The New Pornographers is a Canadian indie rock band formed in 1997 in Vancouver, British Columbia.\n- Kings of Leon is an American rock band formed in 1999 in Nashville, Tennessee.\n- Taylor Locke and The Roughs consists of Taylor Locke of Rooney, Chris Price of Price, Brandon Schwartzel of FIDLAR, and Joe Seiders of The New Pornographers.\n- The 2014 Orange Warsaw Festival took place on 13–15 June 2014 at the National Stadium.\n- Kings of Leon and Queens of the Stone Age headlined Friday 13 June 2014 at the 2014 Orange Warsaw Festival.\n- Florence and the Machine headlined Saturday 14 June 2014 at the 2014 Orange Warsaw Festival.\n- David Guetta and Kasabian headlined Sunday 15 June 2014 at the 2014 Orange Warsaw Festival.",
